        roles: ['Managing Partner, LBH', 'VP Strategy and VP Israel Marketing, Israel Aerospace Industries (through September 2026)', 'Director, ELTA Systems Ltd.', 'Commander, Depth Command (Major General)', 'Commander, 91st Division, Galilee Formation (Brigadier General)', 'Commander, Givati Brigade (Colonel)', 'Commander, Shaldag Unit (Lieutenant Colonel)'],
